<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Sino Land.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Sino Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said its London branch intended to issue 250 million American-style call warrants on shares of Sino Land Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.68     PREMIUM	 9.25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2442   GEARING	 3.42X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  25.AUG.97   PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$8.35</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
